DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45440::$$$message_0423_0000_0000$$$::"So we finally come face to face, Tokiomi Tohsaka."::
45441::$$$message_0423_0000_0001$$$::"Ah, Kayneth El-Melloi Archibald, I take it."::
45442::$$$message_0423_0000_0002$$$::"I've been looking forward to meeting you, as a worthy adversary after the Holy Grail."::
45443::$$$message_0423_0000_0003$$$::"Indeed. I would have no qualms fighting you for the Holy Grail. But..."::
45444::$$$message_0423_0000_0004$$$::"Kayneth, keep up or we're leaving you behind. We still have a long way to reach the onsen."::
45445::$$$message_0423_0000_0005$$$::"..."::
45446::$$$message_0423_0000_0006$$$::"...You too, eh?"::
45447::$$$message_0423_0000_0007$$$::"Still, I can't simply let Archer's Master walk free![wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=ケイネス face=怒2 pos=left time=400 twno=1][hfwww layer=0] Lancer, slow them down. Sola-Ui and I will go on ahead."::
45448::$$$message_0423_0000_0008$$$::"Don't be silly, Kayneth. You're the only one who needs to stay to fight a duel between mages. Lancer and I can go together."::
45449::$$$message_0423_0000_0009$$$::"...No, Lady Sola-Ui. You should leave this fight to me, and go on with Lord Kayneth."::
45450::$$$message_0423_0000_0010$$$::"What's the matter, Kirei? You look delighted."::
45451::$$$message_0423_0000_0011$$$::"Don't be absurd. I can't stand to watch such foolish, unfortunate relationships fall apart."::
45452::$$$message_0423_0000_0012$$$::"It's evident that they'll soon meet the cruelest ending possible... [wvl][hfwww layer=0]And I would [font italic=true]never[font italic=false] want to witness that trainwreck in motion."::
45453::$$$message_0423_0000_0013$$$::"All right, that's plenty. Let's scatter them right away and savor their lamentations. Now, let's go, Tokiomi."::
45454::$$$message_0423_0000_0014$$$::"I... don't feel quite right about this..."::a�